First, the frame goes through `otPlatRadioReceiveDone`, which processes it as an IEEE 802.15.4 frame. It needs to have a valid 802.15.4 header, then get to the MLE layer.

Looking at the seed corpus file `mle-parent-request`, it's 63 bytes and appears to be a valid 802.15.4 frame. I need to construct something similar but as a Parent Response.

